646851,"text":"神の責務を果たすことで神の力を蓄える。だけど、ボクは統治とか嫌なんだ…モンドの人々もそういうの好まないと思うし。","nextNodeIds":[3970209]},{"nodeId":3970209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":3863663699,"text":"「君たちが王のいない自由な城を作ればいい」——バルバトス様の理念を私たちはちゃんと覚えている。","nextNodeIds":[3970210]},{"nodeId":3970210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":998869683,"text":"ジン団長ってば信仰深い！","nextNodeIds":[3970211]},{"nodeId":3970211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4215722555,"text":"単に誰かさんが自由すぎて、仕事をサボっていただけとか考えないんだ。","nextNodeIds":[3970212]},{"nodeId":3970212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":1000543643,"text":"コホン、とにかく、こんなに長くモンドに戻ってなかったボクのことだ…","nextNodeIds":[3970213]},{"nodeId":3970213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":2853598107,"text":"今のボクは紛れもなく、七神の中でも最弱だよ！","nextNodeIds":[3970214,3970215]},{"nodeId":3970214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1181123059,"text":"よく言うよ…","nextNodeIds":[3970216]},{"nodeId":3970216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":1846443595,"text":"そんなに褒めないでよ。","nextNodeIds":[3970217]},{"nodeId":3970217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1009,"speakerName":"ディルック","textMapHash":3441777291,"text":"はぁ…こんな風神様がいるとは、いいんだか悪いんだか。","nextNodeIds":[3970218]},{"nodeId":3970218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1009,"speakerName":"ディルック","textMapHash":2620893619,"text":"七国と七神の話はさておき、まずは人類共通の敵について話そう。","nextNodeIds":[3970219]},{"nodeId":3970219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1009,"speakerName":"ディルック","textMapHash":2611333811,"text":"今回調べた<color=#00E1FFFF>アビスの魔術師の痕跡</color>は、<color=#00E1FFFF>ワイナリー</color>のすぐ近くにあった。","nextNodeIds":[3970220]},{"nodeId":3970220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":2652369099,"text":"そいつを取り逃がしてはいけない。","nextNodeIds":[3970221]},{