tMapHash":3677085227,"text":"アビスの魔術師を倒した後、何かエネルギーが散らばった…","nextNodeIds":[3970403]},{"nodeId":3970403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":1985561283,"text":"このエネルギーは、ボクとトワリンの繋がりを根絶させるためのものみたいだ。","nextNodeIds":[3970404]},{"nodeId":3970404,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":1920632523,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[3970405]},{"nodeId":3970405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":132390699,"text":"<color=#00E1FFFF>「風龍廃墟」</color>を知っているかい？","nextNodeIds":[3970406,3970408]},{"nodeId":3970406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3240272587,"text":"知らない。","nextNodeIds":[3970407]},{"nodeId":3970407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":3726999211,"text":"そう、でもジン団長とディルックなら知ってると思うんだ。","nextNodeIds":[3970410]},{"nodeId":3970410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":3144063691,"text":"今のトワリンは、その廃墟を巣にしている。","nextNodeIds":[3970411]},{"nodeId":3970411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":1951558179,"text":"モンドの周りを封鎖する暴風のように、廃墟の入口にも特殊な障壁があるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[3970412]},{"nodeId":3970412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":793797379,"text":"でも今、アビスの魔術師から散ったエネルギーを使うことで、魔力の織りなす韻律をボクは読み取ることができる。","nextNodeIds":[3970413]},{"nodeId":3970413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":2130786219,"text":"その韻律はヒルチャールの合唱より耳障りだけど…","nextNodeIds":[3970414]},{"nodeId":3970414,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":4061847283,"text":"それでも暴風の障壁を突破して、<color=#00E1FFFF>「風龍廃墟」</color>の内部に行くには十分だ。","nextNodeIds":[3970415]},{"nodeId":3970415,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1009,"speakerName":"ディルック","textMapHash":3863795067,"text":"つまり、トワリンに正面から挑むのか？","nextNodeIds":[3970416]},{"nodeId":3970416,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1009,"speakerName":"ディルック","textMapHash":1306669827,"text":"僕は異論ないが…戦いを回避したいと言っているのはジンだ。","nextNodeIds":[3970417]},{"nodeId":3970417,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":1427057571,"text":"いや、選択肢がない以上、私がその責任を背負う。","nextNodeIds":[3970418]},{"nodeId":3970418,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":3239640091,"text":"もし、トワリンの討伐が唯一の救いの道であるなら、私が先陣を切る騎士となろう。","nextNodeIds":[3970419]},{"nodeId":3970419,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":1426550795,"text":"——大丈夫、まだその段階までは行ってないよ。","nextNodeIds":[3970420]},{"nodeId":3970420,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1009,"speakerName":"ディルック","textMapHash":1384174939,"text":"ん？","nextNodeIds":[3970421]},{"nodeId":3970421,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":39579507,"text":"ウェンティ殿、それは…","nextNodeIds":[3970422]},{"nodeId":3970422,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":2402143291,"text":"つまり、天空のライアーは切り札じゃないってことさ。","nextNodeIds":[3970423]},{"nodeId":3970423,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":2154448643,"text":"#本当の切り札は——{NICKNAME}だよ。","nextNodeIds":[3970424]},{"nodeId":3970424,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":648751987,"text":"#{NICKNAME}が？","nextNodeIds":[3970425,3970427]},{"nodeId":3970425,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3439743891,"text":"涙の結晶を浄化したから？","nextNodeIds":[3970426]},{"nodeId":3970426,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":342617403,"text":"そうだよ。","nextNodeIds":[3970430]},{"nodeId":3970430,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":2844158859,"text":"涙の結晶にあった不純物とトワリンを取り巻く呪いは、同じ類の邪悪なる力だ。","nextNodeIds":[3970431]},{"nodeId":3970431,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","spea